#: ../../source/call-me-maybe_README.md:17
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/call-me-maybe_README.md:19
msgid "maybe(cb, promise)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/call-me-maybe_README.md:21
msgid ""
"If the callback `cb` is truthy, returns `undefined` and will call `cb` "
"when `promise` is settled. The parameters passed to `cb` are standard "
"error-first:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/call-me-maybe_README.md:23
msgid ""
"If `promise` is fulfilled, then it is called with the result of the "
"promise: `cb(null, result)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/call-me-maybe_README.md:24
msgid ""
"If `promise` is rejected, then it is called with the rejection error: "
"`cb(err)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/call-me-maybe_README.md:26
msgid "If `cb` is falsey, then `promise` is returned."
msgstr ""

